Vendored third-party code
-------------------------
code/vendor-jacobian-lens/ is a vendored copy of

    anthropics/jacobian-lens
    https://github.com/anthropics/jacobian-lens
    commit 581d398613e5602a5af361e1c34d3a92ea82ba8e
    License: Apache-2.0 (its LICENSE file is retained in the vendored directory)

the reference implementation accompanying "Verbalizable Representations Form a
Global Workspace in Language Models" (transformer-circuits.pub/2026/workspace).
It is vendored unmodified; our adapter for vision-language models lives outside
it, in code/jlens_vlm.py. Re-clone at the pinned SHA to verify.

